flowchart TD
    A[POST /api/targets] --> B[Receive Target URL or IP]

    B --> C[Validate Format]

    C --> D{Valid URL/IP?}

    D -- No --> E[Return 400 Invalid Target]
    D -- Yes --> F[Check Project Scope Rules]

    F --> G{Target In Scope?}

    G -- No --> H[Block Target]
    H --> I[Return 403 Out of Scope Warning]

    G -- Yes --> J[Save Target in Database]
    J --> K[Return 201 Target Added Successfully]